OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife park breaks stork
OL,4,Abreeding record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife park says it has had its
OL,7,Fmost successful white stork breeding
OL,8,Fseason ever after hatching and rearing
OL,9,F49 chicks for a rewilding programme.
OL,11,FThe White Stork Project aims to
OL,12,Fre-establish a wild, breeding
OL,13,Fpopulation of the birds with at least
OL,14,F50 breeding pairs across the south of
OL,15,FEngland by 2030.
OL,17,FCotswold Wildlife Park has so far bred
OL,18,F280 White Storks for the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
